# Unity 프로젝트는 저장소 루트가 아니라 five_river/ 안에 있다.
# 엔진 출력 폴더는 넓은 패턴(**/Build/ 등) 대신 루트 기준 경로로만 무시한다.
# 넓은 패턴은 Art/Build/, Audio/Temp/ 같은 에셋 폴더까지 무시한다 (claude_all_type_genre.md 14번).
#
# Based on https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/Unity.gitignore
#
.utmp/
/five_river/[Ll]ibrary/
/five_river/[Tt]emp/
/five_river/[Oo]bj/
/five_river/[Bb]uild/
/five_river/[Bb]uilds/
/five_river/[Ll]ogs/
/five_river/[Uu]ser[Ss]ettings/
*.log

# MemoryCaptures can get excessive in size.
# They also could contain extremely sensitive data
/five_river/[Mm]emoryCaptures/

# Recordings can get excessive in size
/five_river/[Rr]ecordings/

# Uncomment this line if you wish to ignore the asset store tools plugin
# /five_river/[Aa]ssets/AssetStoreTools*

# Autogenerated Jetbrains Rider plugin
/five_river/[Aa]ssets/Plugins/Editor/JetBrains*

# Visual Studio cache directory
.vs/

# Gradle cache directory
.gradle/

# Autogenerated VS/MD/Consulo solution and project files
ExportedObj/
.consulo/
*.csproj
*.unityproj
*.sln
*.slnx
*.suo
*.tmp
*.user
*.userprefs
*.pidb
*.booproj
*.svd
*.pdb
*.mdb
*.opendb
*.VC.db

# Unity3D generated meta files
*.pidb.meta
*.pdb.meta
*.mdb.meta

# Unity3D generated file on crash reports
sysinfo.txt

# Builds
*.apk
*.aab
*.unitypackage
*.unitypackage.meta
*.app

# Crashlytics generated file
crashlytics-build.properties

# Packed Addressables
/five_river/[Aa]ssets/[Aa]ddressable[Aa]ssets[Dd]ata/*/*.bin*

# Temporary auto-generated Android Assets
/five_river/[Aa]ssets/[Ss]treamingAssets/aa.meta
/five_river/[Aa]ssets/[Ss]treamingAssets/aa/*
